# **HI-TECH College Portal — Slice 02**

## **Authentication integration, protected routes & Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)**

This slice connects the Staff and Student portals to a secure authentication foundation. It replaces the demonstration-only identity assumption with a reusable auth provider, protected routes, role checks, permission checks, session restoration and redirects.

Goal: No student or staff member can access a portal or function that their authenticated account is not authorized to use.

